      "section_title": "Operating Conditions",
      "anchor": null,
      "text_excerpt": "3.2.4 Operating Conditions\nThe operating voltages are listed below.\nTable 3.3 Operating Condition\nPin Type V_min (if applicable) V_typical V_max (if\napplicable)\nVB 3.1 3.8 4.5\nA1 1.9 - 2.1\nP2 1.75 1.8 1.85\nP3 0 - 3.4\nP4 1.2 1.8 1.89\nP5 1.75"
    },
