      "section_no": "3.4.2",
      "section_title": "Reset Control",
      "anchor": null,
      "text_excerpt": "3.4.2 Reset Control\nThe C16QS module Pin 17th is a reset pin. The application detects that the module is abnormal. When the\nsoftware does not respond, the module can be reset. Pull the pin low for 100-500ms to reset the module. The\nRESET pi"
